{%- comment -%}
  Which seasonal hero copy edition applies on a date (MMDD, shop time). Echoes
  nothing outside the windows (Sep 1 - Dec 2), so the caller keeps its own copy:
  Halloween & winter Sep 1 - Oct 15, Christmas Oct 16 - Dec 2.
  The windows are plain `if mmdd ...` lines: ops/tests/test_hero_season_windows.mjs
  reads this file and asserts every boundary.

  Usage:
  {%- capture hero_window_edition -%}{%- render 'hero-season-window', mmdd: hero_today_mmdd -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign mmdd = mmdd | plus: 0
  if mmdd >= 1203 and mmdd <= 1225
    echo 'winter_photos'
  elsif mmdd >= 1226 and mmdd <= 1231
    echo 'new_year'
  elsif mmdd >= 101 and mmdd <= 110
    echo 'new_year'
  elsif mmdd >= 111 and mmdd <= 214
    echo 'valentines'
  elsif mmdd >= 215 and mmdd <= 831
    echo 'everyday'
  endif
-%}
